01:14:42.912 --> 01:14:58.860
♪

1541
01:15:08.104 --> 01:15:09.403
(sharp thud)

1542
01:15:09.439 --> 01:15:12.273
♪

1543
01:15:12.308 --> 01:15:13.908
Harry?

1544
01:15:13.943 --> 01:15:15.743
Harry, what happened?

1545
01:15:15.778 --> 01:15:19.046
♪

1546
01:15:19.082 --> 01:15:20.915
Put the knife down,

1547
01:15:20.950 --> 01:15:22.517
Harry, are you okay?

1548
01:15:22.619 --> 01:15:24.051
Shut up,

1549
01:15:24.087 --> 01:15:25.386
Put it down,

1550
01:15:25.421 --> 01:15:26.988
-No,
          -Put it down!

1551
01:15:27.123 --> 01:15:28.856
-No!
          -Put it down!

1552
01:15:28.958 --> 01:15:30.691
(gunshot)

1553
01:15:30.793 --> 01:15:33.261
(clanking)

1554
01:15:33.296 --> 01:15:37.231
(Brooke)
      What is happ--Glenn!

1555
01:15:37.267 --> 01:15:38.766
(sounds of struggle)

1556
01:15:38.801 --> 01:15:40.701
Stop, stop!

1557
01:15:40.803 --> 01:15:43.237
(sounds of struggle)

1558
01:15:43.273 --> 01:15:45.540
Glenn, be careful! Olivia!

1559
01:15:45.642 --> 01:15:47.208
Stop! Olivia,,,

1560
01:15:47.310 --> 01:15:49.577
(Glenn cries out)

1561
01:15:49.612 --> 01:15:52.179
(sounds of struggle)

1562
01:15:52.315 --> 01:15:59.287
